menu "RCU validation"

config KFEAT_RCU_TORTURE
    bool "Run RCU ownership stress instead of userspace"
    depends on !KFEAT_WORKQUEUE_BENCH
    default n
    help
      Explicit release-only validation after runtime initialization.
      Does not run under UNITTEST. Reports progress independently of log level
      and powers off after successful completion. Not a performance benchmark.

config RCU_TORTURE_SECONDS
    usize "RCU ownership stress duration in seconds"
    depends on KFEAT_RCU_TORTURE
    range 1 86400
    default 1800
    help
      Complete and verify whole finite batches until this duration elapses.
      Use an external timeout: a stalled batch must fail, not be abandoned.
      Boot and final batch completion may extend the total runtime.

config KFEAT_RCU_BENCH
    bool "Measure RCU read costs and wait latency instead of userspace"
    depends on !KFEAT_WORKQUEUE_BENCH && !KFEAT_RCU_TORTURE
    default n
    help
      Release-only sequential prepared submission, completion and sync waits.
      Also measures baseline, empty read scopes and scoped object read batches.
      Runs separately from torture, with one warmup and three measured rounds
      on each present CPU. Prints raw samples and powers off on completion.
      Not a throughput benchmark; do not enable UNITTEST or coverage.

endmenu
